      "id": "claim_ebfaaf8d679c4060a1b1ae72bc6518cb",
      "statement": "The public `Agent` and `Workflow` APIs are exported from `voly`; `Agent` delegates chat to the gateway and executor work to `AgentRunner`, while `Workflow` compiles nodes into an ordinary Plan run by `PlanRunner` and persisted by `PlanStore`, rather than implementing a second runtime.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://voly/__init__.py#L35-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c7ef8927649915b59ae3f7dbf241dd746002ce61304c4d49b2e19da28f0d0338:"
